WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
00:46.359 --> 00:47.193
Wait.

4
00:47.277 --> 00:48.444
Don't touch me!

5
00:49.320 --> 00:50.655
Don't go.

6
00:54.075 --> 00:55.285
Look.

7
00:56.536 --> 00:58.705
It's fine. Why do you keep running away?

8
00:58.788 --> 01:00.498
Because it's not fine!

9
01:01.332 --> 01:04.586
I could end up killing you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

10
01:07.005 --> 01:08.506
I don't care anymore.

11
01:08.590 --> 01:09.424
It's just…

12
01:10.258 --> 01:11.759
Even just looking at you

13
01:13.178 --> 01:14.304
is scary

14
01:15.221 --> 01:16.639
and painful for me.

15
01:18.850 --> 01:19.684
Please.

16
01:21.269 --> 01:22.979
Just leave. Please.

17
01:46.211 --> 01:48.713
-Bo-bae, you're back. -Come on in.

18
01:49.214 --> 01:51.424
What are you guys doing?

19
01:51.507 --> 01:53.635
I told them. Come sit here.

20
01:57.222 --> 01:58.598
"Triggers for Bo-bae's Powers."

21
01:58.681 --> 02:00.642
"Protocols for Bo-bae's Electrical Incidents."

22
02:01.351 --> 02:02.227
"Conductive Materials."

23
02:03.144 --> 02:05.271
"Damage Claims and Reimbursement Log."

24
02:06.147 --> 02:07.941
"Bo-bae's Electrical Anomalies."

25
02:14.614 --> 02:16.824
First. "The cockroach incident."

26
02:24.249 --> 02:25.166
A cockroach!

27
02:25.250 --> 02:27.085
-Ji-hye! -What's wrong? What happened?

28
02:27.168 --> 02:29.629
A cockroach! Ji-hye, hurry up and catch it.

29
02:30.588 --> 02:33.258
-Ji-hye! -Mom!

30
02:33.758 --> 02:36.511
Ji-hye, are you okay?

31
02:36.594 --> 02:38.721
Na Bo-bae is so annoying.

32
02:40.807 --> 02:42.725
-Mom. -Hey, just a second!

33
02:47.230 --> 02:48.231
Bo-bae.

34
02:51.526 --> 02:54.279
"After that, her powers were gone for an hour and a half."

35
02:55.029 --> 02:56.239
"The first anomaly."

36
02:57.407 --> 02:59.826
Second. The Christmas Santa incident.

37
03:06.916 --> 03:08.918
Santa?

38
03:09.585 --> 03:10.420
Bo-bae.

39
03:11.838 --> 03:14.465
What? It's you, Dad.

40
03:14.549 --> 03:15.383
Huh?

41
03:16.801 --> 03:19.595
No, I'm Santa.

42
03:20.638 --> 03:23.057
It's you, Dad!

43
03:23.141 --> 03:24.517
No, I'm not.

44
03:27.312 --> 03:29.564
"After that, her powers were gone for four hours."

45
03:29.647 --> 03:31.733
"Does she lose her powers when startled?"

46
03:31.816 --> 03:36.738
"Or is it because she used too much of her powers in one go?"

47
03:38.698 --> 03:42.160
One summer, she passed out while supplying power to a broken AC

48
03:42.243 --> 03:44.370
and lost her powers for 24 hours.

49
03:44.454 --> 03:48.291
Someone got stuck in the subway doors, and she fixed them with her powers--

50
03:48.374 --> 03:51.919
Yes, we know. She's been without powers for up to 48 hours before.

51
03:52.003 --> 03:53.004
That's right.

52
03:53.087 --> 03:57.008
Bo-bae, did you overuse your electrical powers recently?

53
03:59.010 --> 04:00.386
Recently?

54
04:15.943 --> 04:18.237
Yeah. I did.

55
04:20.198 --> 04:23.368
I did save someone who went into cardiac arrest, but…

56
04:23.451 --> 04:24.452
What?

57
04:25.495 --> 04:26.579
Huh?

58
04:26.662 --> 04:31.209
But my powers came back at Yong-gi's dojo today.

59
04:31.918 --> 04:32.752
What?

60
04:38.424 --> 04:39.258
What's up?

61
04:47.892 --> 04:48.726
What is it?

62
04:48.810 --> 04:50.978
-Watch your step. -Okay.

63
04:52.522 --> 04:54.023
Careful.

64
04:54.107 --> 04:55.108
Oh dear.

65
04:55.733 --> 04:56.567
Careful.

66
05:00.696 --> 05:01.906
The lights are back on.

67
05:01.989 --> 05:03.282
-Oh man. -Huh?

68
05:03.783 --> 05:04.951
What's this?

69
05:05.034 --> 05:08.287
The building's old. Sometimes the lights go out on their own.

70
05:08.371 --> 05:09.705
I have to tap the fuse box.

71
05:10.373 --> 05:12.417
No wonder the rent was so cheap.

72
05:12.500 --> 05:14.794
I told you to do your research before signing the lease.

73
05:15.461 --> 05:18.381
-The landlord said everything was fixed. -Hold on.

74
05:18.464 --> 05:19.632
So you're saying

75
05:19.715 --> 05:23.636
the sparks and the lights going out wasn't because of me?

76
05:23.719 --> 05:25.972
Oh, no. That happens all the time.

77
05:26.055 --> 05:27.723
-What? All the time? -Gosh.

78
05:27.807 --> 05:29.600
When did your powers go away?

79
05:30.393 --> 05:32.812
I'm not sure exactly,

80
05:33.729 --> 05:36.065
but I noticed it two nights ago.

81
05:36.566 --> 05:38.818
Around 9 p.m.? 9:30?

82
05:39.777 --> 05:41.904
So it's been

83
05:41.988 --> 05:45.908
about 45 hours.

84
05:45.992 --> 05:47.869
It hasn't been 48 hours yet, right?

85
05:47.952 --> 05:49.829
But the CPR was two weeks ago.

86
05:49.912 --> 05:51.956
Shouldn't we count from then?

87
05:52.039 --> 05:56.586
You said you found out two nights ago.

88
05:56.669 --> 05:59.380
Let's just wait until the 48-hour mark.

89
05:59.464 --> 06:02.508
If your powers aren't back by then, we'll know for sure.

90
06:02.592 --> 06:04.677
It would be a new record.

91
06:04.760 --> 06:07.805
We'll have to wait and see if it's really gone, right?

92
06:08.973 --> 06:09.807
For real?

93
06:09.891 --> 06:11.017
That's awesome.

94
06:11.726 --> 06:13.436
-Huh? -Not again.

95
06:15.021 --> 06:18.024
-I told you to check everything. -You had us all confused!

96
06:18.107 --> 06:20.568
Tell the landlord to fix it right away. Seriously…

97
06:20.651 --> 06:23.154
Okay, I will.

98
06:29.869 --> 06:31.954
Even just looking at you is scary

99
06:32.497 --> 06:34.248
and painful for me.

100
06:34.832 --> 06:35.958
Please.

101
06:37.752 --> 06:39.378
Just leave. Please.

102
06:42.298 --> 06:46.385
Hey, you should've looked into it properly instead of rushing things.

103
06:46.469 --> 06:48.012
Call the landlord right now.

104
06:48.095 --> 06:49.847
-I heard you. -He's just like someone.

105
06:49.931 --> 06:51.057
Exactly the same.

106
06:51.140 --> 06:52.934
-What? -He takes after me.

107
06:53.017 --> 06:55.186
Take after you? I take after Mom.

108
06:55.269 --> 06:56.103
A cat!

109
06:56.187 --> 06:58.773
-Over there! A stray cat! -Is it Gela? My sweet Angela?

110
06:58.856 --> 06:59.941
-In there. -Who's Angela?

111
07:00.024 --> 07:01.609
-She's back early. -Your first love?

112
07:01.692 --> 07:04.779
She's my final love, you punk. I always feed that cat.

113
07:04.862 --> 07:06.781
Your dad's last first love was…

114
07:06.864 --> 07:08.950
Why are you still here?

115
07:10.368 --> 07:11.536
Quick! Hide!

116
07:17.625 --> 07:19.377
What if my family sees you?

117
07:20.002 --> 07:21.170
I told you.

118
07:21.963 --> 07:23.756
I feel like I'd die without you.

119
07:26.467 --> 07:27.969
But things are different now.

120
07:28.719 --> 07:30.012
It's not the same anymore.

121
07:32.181 --> 07:33.391
Nothing has changed.

122
07:33.474 --> 07:35.935
If we live together like before and find a way--

123
07:36.018 --> 07:37.019
What is this about?

124
07:41.899 --> 07:42.775
You lived together?

125
07:43.609 --> 07:44.735
You mean,

126
07:44.819 --> 07:46.862
under the same roof?

127
07:48.239 --> 07:50.992
Like eating and sleeping together?

128
07:51.075 --> 07:52.577
Are you two

129
07:53.202 --> 07:54.495
dating?

130
07:54.579 --> 07:56.247
No, it's not like that.

131
07:56.330 --> 07:57.290
To be precise,

132
07:58.207 --> 07:59.458
we were officially dating.

133
08:00.793 --> 08:03.087
But when I was unconscious after nearly dying,

134
08:04.338 --> 08:05.798
Ms. Na Bo-bae

135
08:06.716 --> 08:08.342
abandoned me and ran away.

136
08:10.845 --> 08:12.013
No.

137
08:12.096 --> 08:14.724
You make it sound like I'm a piece of trash.

138
08:16.934 --> 08:19.478
That makes me the father of a piece of trash.

139
08:20.396 --> 08:21.230
Hey.

140
08:22.690 --> 08:24.066
Let's talk inside.

141
08:26.402 --> 08:27.737
Let's go inside. Come on.

142
08:29.697 --> 08:30.990
Come on.

143
08:56.390 --> 08:57.600
So

144
08:58.100 --> 09:00.728
you followed Bo-bae here because you like her?

145
09:01.812 --> 09:03.606
That's what stalkers do.

146
09:03.689 --> 09:06.359
He's been following Bo-bae around for ages.

147
09:06.442 --> 09:08.903
-He even came to your café, right? -Hey.

148
09:08.986 --> 09:12.156
He was a very important customer. Don't talk about him like that.

149
09:12.239 --> 09:13.532
He's a VIP at my café.

150
09:13.616 --> 09:14.533
What does he do?

151
09:14.617 --> 09:15.534
I'm…

152
09:17.119 --> 09:19.538
I'm self-employed too.

153
09:19.622 --> 09:21.415
I'm in the lodging business.

154
09:22.166 --> 09:23.292
I see.

155
09:23.376 --> 09:26.796
We moved here after retiring. Now we grow and sell Shine Muscat grapes.

156
09:26.879 --> 09:28.798
It's really late now.

157
09:28.881 --> 09:30.841
I told you to leave earlier.

158
09:30.925 --> 09:33.427
What? She told you to leave, but you didn't listen?

159
09:34.303 --> 09:36.013
Geez, this guy is dangerous.

160
09:36.097 --> 09:37.348
Hold on.

161
09:37.431 --> 09:39.600
He said they dated.

162
09:40.267 --> 09:42.853
Then what about the electrical powers?

163
09:43.521 --> 09:45.022
He was never

164
09:45.856 --> 09:46.941
affected by her powers.

165
09:47.024 --> 09:48.025
-What? -What?

166
09:48.109 --> 09:49.193
They didn't affect him?

167
09:49.777 --> 09:52.863
Yeah, I guess not.

168
09:52.947 --> 09:56.701
I don't care about her electrical powers.

169
09:56.784 --> 09:59.453
I'm here because I want to be with Ms. Na Bo-bae.

170
10:00.162 --> 10:02.707
It's all I ever wanted, then and now.

171
10:03.416 --> 10:04.709
Oh my.

172
10:04.792 --> 10:08.462
I like this guy, then I don't, and now I like him again.

173
10:08.546 --> 10:10.673
A man shouldn't give up easily.

174
10:10.756 --> 10:14.135
-Reminds me of my younger days. -Gosh, Dad.

175
10:14.218 --> 10:15.886
Anyway, it's late.

176
10:15.970 --> 10:18.180
We should let him stay the night, don't you think?

177
10:18.264 --> 10:19.765
I don't think so.

178
10:19.849 --> 10:21.600
If he stays, he pays.

179
10:22.226 --> 10:25.896
You run a lodging business, so you should know how business works.

180
10:36.031 --> 10:36.907
PRECIOUS SHINE MUSCAT JAM

181
10:36.991 --> 10:38.409
Pack 100 boxes before bed.

182
10:42.079 --> 10:43.539
A hundred boxes?

183
10:43.622 --> 10:45.750
This is my parents' main product.

184
10:46.459 --> 10:48.335
Consider it payment for your stay.

185
10:49.378 --> 10:51.255
And do not go near Bo-bae's room.

186
10:52.089 --> 10:54.383
I shall be keeping a close eye on you.

187
12:08.666 --> 12:09.959
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

188
12:10.918 --> 12:11.961
Are you asleep?

189
12:24.849 --> 12:26.141
Ms. Na,

190
12:26.851 --> 12:29.353
I'll just talk to you from here.

191
12:33.816 --> 12:34.942
I…

192
12:36.193 --> 12:38.195
After you disappeared…

193
12:40.823 --> 12:41.949
I really felt

194
12:43.784 --> 12:45.536
like I was going to die.

195
12:48.789 --> 12:50.541
For the first time…

196
12:52.918 --> 12:56.088
I felt like I might die because of someone else

197
12:57.923 --> 13:00.718
instead of my own heart.

198
13:03.762 --> 13:05.389
I know you're doing this…

199
13:08.601 --> 13:10.603
because you're worried…

200
13:13.397 --> 13:14.857
you might put me in danger.

201
13:18.986 --> 13:20.029
If…

202
13:22.907 --> 13:26.577
I really do end up in danger because of your powers…

203
13:32.207 --> 13:35.336
I'll find a way somehow.

204
13:40.424 --> 13:41.675
Just don't tell me

205
13:43.427 --> 13:44.595
to leave.

206
14:23.968 --> 14:25.135
Bo-bae?

207
14:26.053 --> 14:27.304
It's Mom.

208
14:33.852 --> 14:34.770
What is it?

209
14:37.356 --> 14:39.441
We didn't mean to, but we heard everything.

210
14:41.360 --> 14:43.112
Your dad was moved to tears.

211
14:45.072 --> 14:47.700
Shoot. You heard all that?

212
14:47.783 --> 14:50.202
You could've covered your ears.

213
14:50.786 --> 14:53.831
Hey, it's not my fault our walls are paper-thin.

214
14:54.540 --> 14:56.917
You two could've gone outside to talk.

215
14:57.001 --> 14:59.503
Or you could've texted. You have phones.

216
15:00.087 --> 15:02.464
So what if you heard us?

217
15:04.800 --> 15:07.678
You're just happy I have a boyfriend, right?

218
15:07.761 --> 15:10.764
And thrilled my powers may be gone for good, right?

219
15:10.848 --> 15:12.891
Of course I'm happy.

220
15:14.018 --> 15:17.312
I know how much you've been struggling on your own.

221
15:21.817 --> 15:25.821
We may know a lot about your electrical powers,

222
15:27.448 --> 15:29.450
but we can never know how you feel.

223
15:30.576 --> 15:32.077
How could we ever know

224
15:32.578 --> 15:35.539
how scared and lonely you were…

225
15:38.083 --> 15:39.668
so young and all alone?

226
15:41.086 --> 15:41.920
Right?

227
15:43.380 --> 15:45.299
What's gotten into you?

228
15:48.802 --> 15:53.098
When you said you wanted to be a writer, it broke my heart.

229
15:53.849 --> 15:58.312
You must've wanted to write because you had so much bottled up inside.

230
15:59.772 --> 16:02.608
You must've been so lonely, with no one to open up to,

231
16:03.108 --> 16:04.902
that you had to pour it all onto paper.

232
16:07.071 --> 16:08.155
So I'm happy.

233
16:09.031 --> 16:10.074
I'm glad.

234
16:10.699 --> 16:13.869
That you now have someone to whisper to and share things with.

235
16:22.795 --> 16:23.921
Always choose the path

236
16:24.880 --> 16:26.590
that makes you happy.

237
16:27.841 --> 16:32.304
Whether you have electrical powers or not, whether you're with someone or not,

238
16:33.931 --> 16:35.265
wherever you are,

239
16:35.349 --> 16:37.601
find something that makes you happy first.

240
16:39.561 --> 16:42.314
Then you'll be on the right path.

241
16:49.279 --> 16:50.447
Gosh.

242
16:52.241 --> 16:53.617
It's so nice

243
16:54.868 --> 16:57.204
to hold my daughter in my arms again.

244
17:02.334 --> 17:04.211
Senior Managing Director Choi is here.

245
17:14.972 --> 17:15.848
Mr. Yoon.

246
17:18.684 --> 17:19.685
Hello.

247
17:20.310 --> 17:21.145
Mr. Lee.

248
17:36.869 --> 17:40.664
First-week coverage after launch was 130% above our forecast.

249
17:41.582 --> 17:43.750
Brand asset usage was also highly effective.

250
17:43.834 --> 17:45.460
How many major placements?

251
17:45.544 --> 17:48.130
Thirty-two in total. I've shared the list.

252
17:48.755 --> 17:49.590
Mr. Baek…

253
17:50.382 --> 17:51.216
I mean…

254
17:52.467 --> 17:55.387
Mr. Choi. Have you checked the list?

255
17:55.470 --> 17:56.722
No, I haven't.

256
17:56.805 --> 17:59.308
I'm sure the employees did a good job.

257
17:59.391 --> 18:01.101
TS pays them plenty.

258
18:02.728 --> 18:03.645
Oh.

259
18:03.729 --> 18:05.314
Of course.

260
18:09.610 --> 18:14.281
Ms. Han, that color looks really good on you today.

261
18:15.991 --> 18:17.409
What's your best color?

262
18:17.993 --> 18:21.121
Mr. Choi Do-yoon, may I have a word?

263
18:32.841 --> 18:34.885
-What are you doing? -What do you mean?

264
18:34.968 --> 18:38.138
I know you're excited to run TS Resort, even if it's temporary.

265
18:38.222 --> 18:39.556
But do your job properly--

266
18:39.640 --> 18:41.975
"Temporary"? Who said it's temporary?

267
18:42.059 --> 18:43.143
What?

268
18:43.227 --> 18:46.480
TS Resort, and eventually TS Group, will be mine.

269
18:46.563 --> 18:48.232
It's only a matter of time.

270
18:49.524 --> 18:51.193
I have my grandmother's support.

271
18:52.653 --> 18:54.905
-I thought it was just until Mr. Baek-- -No.

272
18:55.906 --> 18:56.949
I've been chosen.

273
18:57.991 --> 19:00.327
Do you know what Baek Ho-rang is up to?

274
19:00.911 --> 19:02.621
He's looking for Na Bo-bae.

275
19:03.121 --> 19:06.500
He's been running all over the place, completely lost.

276
19:08.252 --> 19:10.337
TS doesn't care about him anymore.

277
19:10.837 --> 19:14.174
Do you think someone like my grandmother would take him back?

278
19:15.509 --> 19:19.805
So that means I'm the official heir now.

279
19:21.431 --> 19:24.977
You said you'd consider marrying me if I became the heir to TS.

280
19:28.021 --> 19:29.064
Does that still stand?

281
19:43.453 --> 19:44.413
My gosh.

282
19:47.958 --> 19:49.960
What are you doing so early?

283
19:50.043 --> 19:50.961
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

284
19:52.296 --> 19:53.297
Good morning.

285
19:54.131 --> 19:56.258
Are you still doing this?

286
19:56.341 --> 19:58.051
I finished the 100 boxes.

287
19:58.135 --> 20:00.721
Now I'm doing it as a form of meditation.

288
20:00.804 --> 20:02.097
Don't mind me.

289
20:02.180 --> 20:04.099
My son-in-law is good with his hands.

290
20:04.182 --> 20:05.267
"Son-in-law"?

291
20:05.350 --> 20:08.687
My son-in-law is a quick learner. Just like his future father-in-law.

292
20:10.147 --> 20:12.816
This is our farm's Insta. Ho-rang made it for us.

293
20:13.400 --> 20:14.234
"Ho-rang"?

294
20:14.318 --> 20:17.237
Yeah, a great name. Roar! Ho-rang, like "tiger."

295
20:17.321 --> 20:20.198
An energetic name that embodies the spirit of Korea.

296
20:20.282 --> 20:23.243
Listen, the person I respect most is Baekbeom.

297
20:23.827 --> 20:26.538
He's quick with his hands and has a head for business.

298
20:26.621 --> 20:27.706
But…

299
20:29.333 --> 20:30.208
Na Bo-bae.

300
20:30.292 --> 20:33.295
How are your electrical powers? It's been over 48 hours.

301
20:33.795 --> 20:35.297
I still can't use them.

302
20:35.380 --> 20:37.132
Wow, what's going on?

303
20:37.883 --> 20:40.218
Mom! It's been over 48 hours.

304
20:40.302 --> 20:42.179
-No way! Then… -I know, right?

305
20:42.262 --> 20:43.221
What's happening?

306
20:43.930 --> 20:46.350
-It's good if they stay gone. -Forty-eight hours?

307
20:46.433 --> 20:47.517
It's the first time.

308
20:47.601 --> 20:52.356
My electrical powers have never been gone for more than 48 hours before.

309
20:52.856 --> 20:55.400
So what happens after 48 hours?

310
20:56.026 --> 20:56.943
I don't know yet.

311
20:57.527 --> 21:00.113
It's been over 48 hours, and your powers haven't returned.

312
21:00.947 --> 21:04.201
Doesn't that mean your powers are gone for good?

313
21:05.118 --> 21:08.705
Well, I guess you could see it that way.

314
21:09.206 --> 21:10.624
Ho-rang.

315
21:19.633 --> 21:22.886
Mr. Lee told me to stock up on healthy desserts.

316
21:22.969 --> 21:25.722
Sugar-free and gluten-free.

317
21:27.599 --> 21:29.351
Why can't he just eat whatever?

318
21:31.520 --> 21:32.604
Ladies.

319
21:34.022 --> 21:37.359
You all know what kind of person Mr. Baek is.

320
21:38.276 --> 21:39.361
He'll be back soon.

321
21:40.445 --> 21:41.321
Of course.

322
21:41.405 --> 21:44.991
Mr. Baek always has plans A to Z.

323
21:45.492 --> 21:48.829
I'm sure he's already gearing up to come back.

324
21:48.912 --> 21:49.788
That's right.

325
21:54.584 --> 21:55.419
Huh?

326
21:56.211 --> 21:58.046
Mr. Yoon, Ms. Go.

327
21:58.130 --> 22:00.090
Isn't this Mr. Baek?

328
22:00.590 --> 22:02.134
Why is Mr. Baek here?

329
22:07.013 --> 22:08.682
#DMTOORDER #PRECIOUS #SHINEMUSCATJAM

330
22:08.765 --> 22:09.766
#HEARTHEALTH #VITAMINS

331
22:09.850 --> 22:11.184
Here, son-in-law.

332
22:11.268 --> 22:12.394
Try this too.

333
22:12.477 --> 22:13.645
Thank you, Mother.

334
22:15.814 --> 22:20.026
Our family knows how to reward hard work. You worked hard, so eat your fill.

335
22:20.110 --> 22:21.403
My tiger son-in-law.

336
22:21.987 --> 22:22.821
Thank you.

337
22:24.030 --> 22:26.783
-I see you're addressing him differently. -I know, right?

338
22:32.414 --> 22:33.874
"The owner is so handsome"?

339
22:34.499 --> 22:36.126
I'm pretty good-looking myself.

340
22:37.127 --> 22:38.170
Huh?

341
22:38.253 --> 22:40.255
Ji-hye, what is this?

342
22:42.215 --> 22:46.136
Looks like someone reposted it, saying the guy in the picture is handsome.

343
22:46.720 --> 22:50.390
Once something like this goes viral, people click right away.

344
22:50.474 --> 22:52.100
"Viral"? Is that a theme park ride?

345
22:52.684 --> 22:57.355
Oh, I noticed earlier that orders for our jam have increased tenfold.

346
22:57.439 --> 22:58.440
Really?

347
22:58.523 --> 22:59.524
Son-in-law.

348
22:59.608 --> 23:01.067
Can you pack a few more?

349
23:01.902 --> 23:03.487
No problem, Mother.

350
23:03.987 --> 23:07.115
Hey, you guys, help my son-in-law pack the jam

351
23:07.199 --> 23:10.494
while your dad and I are out at the farm today, okay?

352
23:10.577 --> 23:11.411
Okay.

353
23:11.495 --> 23:12.412
-Sure. -Yeah.

354
23:13.413 --> 23:15.040
Son-in-law, let's take another one.

355
23:15.957 --> 23:17.334
-Yeah. That's it. -Me too.

356
23:19.377 --> 23:21.463
That's exactly how I looked when I was young.

357
23:45.445 --> 23:47.531
What on earth are you doing here, sir?

358
23:47.614 --> 23:50.617
Do you know how dire things are at TS Resort?

359
23:51.201 --> 23:53.995
I told you I wouldn't go back until I found her.

360
23:54.079 --> 23:56.790
But you found her. You should come back now!

361
23:57.290 --> 23:59.376
You have no idea how bad things are.

362
23:59.459 --> 24:00.835
Senior Managing Director Choi…

363
24:00.919 --> 24:04.714
Choi Do-yoon is all excited about marrying Director Han.

364
24:04.798 --> 24:07.133
Good for him. It's what he wanted.

365
24:07.217 --> 24:08.093
Sir.

366
24:08.176 --> 24:09.219
"Sir"?

367
24:10.011 --> 24:10.845
Who is…

368
24:10.929 --> 24:15.225
Oh! These are Ms. Na Bo-bae's parents,

369
24:15.308 --> 24:20.188
the owners of the Precious Shine Muscat Jam.

370
24:20.272 --> 24:22.107
And this is her brother.

371
24:27.487 --> 24:29.906
Hello, I'm Senior Managing Director Baek's--

372
24:30.740 --> 24:32.909
This is a friend of mine.

373
24:32.993 --> 24:34.703
I asked him to help us pack the jam.

374
24:34.786 --> 24:36.580
The more hands, the better, right?

375
24:37.497 --> 24:39.374
That's great!

376
24:39.874 --> 24:42.002
You really know what you're doing.

377
24:42.085 --> 24:43.128
See? I told you.

378
24:43.211 --> 24:45.505
He's a diamond in the rough, but he'll go far.

379
24:45.589 --> 24:46.965
A Siberian tiger!

380
24:47.048 --> 24:48.550
Roar!

381
24:49.050 --> 24:50.051
We're off to the farm.

382
24:50.135 --> 24:51.428
Okay. Take care.

383
24:52.178 --> 24:53.597
-Pack 'em up. -Yes, sir.

384
25:05.108 --> 25:06.443
-Let's go inside. -Sorry?

385
25:07.944 --> 25:08.903
Sir?

386
25:19.497 --> 25:21.750
Sir, are you really going to do this?

387
25:22.459 --> 25:26.421
I'm not going back to Seoul without Ms. Na Bo-bae.

388
25:26.504 --> 25:29.716
Why are you using me as an excuse?

389
25:30.216 --> 25:31.676
If Ms. Na stays,

390
25:31.760 --> 25:33.970
I can stay here forever.

391
25:35.388 --> 25:36.264
Sir.

392
25:36.348 --> 25:39.142
Everyone's so desperate.

393
25:39.934 --> 25:41.561
What about your goal?

394
25:43.104 --> 25:45.607
Didn't you want to change TS Group?

395
25:46.191 --> 25:47.400
Fold that corner properly.

396
25:48.360 --> 25:49.194
I'm sorry.

397
25:52.155 --> 25:53.114
Bo-bae.

398
25:54.240 --> 25:57.535
You know it's been well over 48 hours since your powers stopped, right?

399
26:01.164 --> 26:02.165
So what?

400
26:02.248 --> 26:04.834
Nothing. Just saying.

401
26:07.629 --> 26:09.089
Hurry up and fold!

402
26:09.172 --> 26:10.965
We have to fill today's orders.

403
26:11.049 --> 26:12.592
Yes, sir.

404
26:22.602 --> 26:23.687
Come on in.

405
26:26.481 --> 26:27.982
President Baek, you're here too.

406
26:28.066 --> 26:30.485
I thought it was just a meal with Do-yoon.

407
26:31.277 --> 26:32.195
Sit next to him.

408
26:39.786 --> 26:42.163
I heard you're looking at wedding dresses tomorrow.

409
26:42.247 --> 26:43.456
I thought we should meet.

410
26:44.457 --> 26:45.583
Wedding dresses.

411
26:46.418 --> 26:47.252
Right.

412
26:49.462 --> 26:51.297
Do-yoon did say we should go look.

413
26:53.007 --> 26:55.468
How about we have the formal family meeting this week?

414
26:55.552 --> 26:57.387
It would just be your father, correct?

415
26:58.388 --> 27:00.056
Is your stepmother still bed-bound?

416
27:02.058 --> 27:02.892
Yes.

417
27:02.976 --> 27:05.812
Right. Well, the four of us can have a simple meal,

418
27:05.895 --> 27:07.689
book the venue, and set the date.

419
27:07.772 --> 27:10.650
My husband can't make it anyway.

420
27:10.734 --> 27:13.403
Right. He's in prison.

421
27:14.320 --> 27:15.739
That's right.

422
27:16.489 --> 27:19.367
I mean, you didn't have to put it so bluntly.

423
27:21.911 --> 27:22.829
Oh, right.

424
27:22.912 --> 27:26.332
I heard Hanlim Advertising Company is handling the Sterling project.

425
27:27.667 --> 27:32.213
You can help us with Sterling and help steer TS.

426
27:32.297 --> 27:34.716
Just thinking about it makes me so happy.

427
27:34.799 --> 27:37.093
It paints a perfect picture, you know?

428
27:38.762 --> 27:42.182
Mom, do we have to talk about work here?

429
27:42.265 --> 27:44.517
Aren't you getting ahead of yourselves?

430
27:44.601 --> 27:45.435
Huh?

431
27:45.518 --> 27:48.062
Senior Managing Director Baek Ho-rang, no…

432
27:48.146 --> 27:50.940
We don't know how Mr. Baek Ho-rang will react.

433
27:51.566 --> 27:56.362
I understand he had also been pushing for the Sterling Group contract.

434
27:56.946 --> 27:59.032
But he isn't in Seoul right now.

435
27:59.657 --> 28:02.994
I heard he's working at some grape farm.

436
28:03.077 --> 28:04.412
He followed Na Bo-bae there.

437
28:06.289 --> 28:07.165
Na Bo-bae?

438
28:07.665 --> 28:09.334
Sir.

439
28:09.417 --> 28:10.543
You'll hurt your back.

440
28:10.627 --> 28:12.962
Don't strain yourself. I'll handle everything.

441
28:13.838 --> 28:14.839
Thanks.

442
28:17.801 --> 28:19.052
Hey, Ho-rang.

443
28:19.552 --> 28:20.595
Yes?

444
28:20.678 --> 28:22.222
You should go back to Seoul today.

445
28:25.308 --> 28:26.142
Sorry?

446
28:26.226 --> 28:28.603
That man came all the way here to find his boss.

447
28:29.604 --> 28:32.524
You can't just abandon your business, even if it's hard.

448
28:34.400 --> 28:38.071
Finding Ms. Na Bo-bae was more important.

449
28:38.154 --> 28:39.948
I like that you put Bo-bae first.

450
28:40.990 --> 28:43.618
But now that I've started my own business,

451
28:43.701 --> 28:47.413
customers waiting for our jam have moved up my priority list.

452
28:47.997 --> 28:51.584
Once they place an order, they rely on me to fulfill it.

453
28:54.128 --> 28:56.339
A boss should never forget that.

454
28:57.340 --> 29:00.969
So you should go back and see it through, win or lose.

455
29:02.637 --> 29:03.680
Go get 'em, Tiger.

456
29:13.690 --> 29:14.524
Let's go back.

457
29:17.360 --> 29:18.194
What?

458
29:18.862 --> 29:21.698
This is the longest I've gone without my powers.

459
29:21.781 --> 29:22.949
It's a new record.

460
29:25.034 --> 29:27.871
It's my first time, so I'm a little scared, but…

461
29:29.122 --> 29:30.415
Let's go back to Seoul.

462
29:32.584 --> 29:33.501
Let's

463
29:34.711 --> 29:35.545
go together.

464
29:37.881 --> 29:38.923
Are you serious?

465
29:39.007 --> 29:41.759
You said you'd die without me.

466
29:42.260 --> 29:44.554
That you feel at ease when you see me.

467
29:44.637 --> 29:46.556
I feel the same way.

468
29:46.639 --> 29:47.974
I

469
29:49.017 --> 29:50.351
need you too.

470
29:52.437 --> 29:53.938
So let's go.

471
29:55.690 --> 29:58.568
Even if it's scary and new,

472
29:59.277 --> 30:00.111
let's go together.

473
30:09.579 --> 30:10.538
Okay.

474
30:11.164 --> 30:12.165
Let's go.

475
30:13.458 --> 30:15.793
Even if it's scary and new,

476
30:16.544 --> 30:17.420
let's go together.

477
30:20.840 --> 30:22.634
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

478
30:22.717 --> 30:25.178
Don't hug her so tight! You'll break her ribs.

479
30:25.261 --> 30:28.598
Should we look for a venue for them while we prepare for your wedding?

480
30:28.681 --> 30:30.808
My gosh, Mom. Don't get carried away.

481
30:30.892 --> 30:32.352
Hey, pull him off her.

482
30:32.852 --> 30:33.853
Why? They look good.

483
30:33.937 --> 30:35.229
Take care!

484
30:36.105 --> 30:38.566
-Oh my! -Bye!

485
30:39.067 --> 30:39.901
What?

486
30:40.401 --> 30:42.445
Could you please reconsider?

487
30:42.946 --> 30:45.031
You can't…

488
30:45.114 --> 30:47.450
All right. Understood.

489
30:58.419 --> 30:59.462
You're here, sir.

490
31:01.005 --> 31:02.924
It's the end of the day. Why so tense?

491
31:03.424 --> 31:05.843
Well, the thing is…

492
31:06.386 --> 31:09.347
We got a call from Sterling, sir.

493
31:09.430 --> 31:12.225
As you know, we have a meeting with them in a few days.

494
31:13.476 --> 31:16.521
They want to cancel it.

495
31:16.604 --> 31:19.273
Wasn't it a big deal? Them expanding into Asia?

496
31:19.357 --> 31:20.483
They're canceling it?

497
31:20.566 --> 31:21.442
Yes.

498
31:21.526 --> 31:25.029
Isn't TS their exclusive partner? What can they do without us?

499
31:25.613 --> 31:29.075
Well, they didn't cancel it altogether.

500
31:30.034 --> 31:31.536
They had one condition.

501
31:32.954 --> 31:36.457
You recently became the senior managing director.

502
31:37.375 --> 31:42.046
They said they're open to meeting with you after you've settled into your role.

503
31:42.130 --> 31:44.632
That's their condition.

504
31:56.394 --> 31:57.395
What?

505
31:57.478 --> 31:58.396
So…

506
32:00.398 --> 32:06.696
First, they want to see you demonstrate what you're capable of, and then--

507
32:06.779 --> 32:08.072
Keep it simple.

508
32:09.115 --> 32:13.244
So they're canceling it because I'm not Baek Ho-rang.

509
32:13.327 --> 32:14.787
No.

510
32:14.871 --> 32:18.249
That's not exactly what they said, but…

511
32:18.916 --> 32:20.918
Well, Senior Managing Director Baek is…

512
32:27.091 --> 32:28.718
"Senior Managing Director Baek"?

513
32:29.677 --> 32:31.846
Hey. Is he still the senior managing director?

514
32:32.847 --> 32:34.724
No, I misspoke. I'm sorry, sir.

515
32:36.017 --> 32:36.851
Get lost.

516
33:04.087 --> 33:05.254
Ms. Han.

517
33:05.755 --> 33:08.591
The meeting with Sterling on the 23rd has been canceled.

518
33:09.258 --> 33:11.427
They won't meet unless it's with Mr. Baek.

519
33:14.055 --> 33:14.889
Well…

520
33:15.640 --> 33:19.811
Could you please try to persuade him?

521
33:22.647 --> 33:25.525
He's holed up on some farm. How am I supposed to persuade him?

522
33:25.608 --> 33:27.485
I spoke to Mr. Yoon earlier.

523
33:28.903 --> 33:30.363
He's coming back to Seoul today.

524
33:31.739 --> 33:32.573
What?

525
34:12.155 --> 34:15.575
You left everything as it was?

526
34:16.200 --> 34:17.493
If I had cleaned it up,

527
34:18.828 --> 34:21.789
it would've felt like you were really gone.

528
34:23.958 --> 34:27.420
And I wanted to leave a place for you to come back to.

529
34:42.393 --> 34:45.730
Our contract's over, but there's one thing left on my romance bucket list.

530
34:48.441 --> 34:51.903
It's your birthday party. Are you sure you want to have it here?

531
34:53.279 --> 34:55.281
We could go somewhere else if you want.

532
34:55.364 --> 34:56.949
This is all I need.

533
34:57.033 --> 34:57.909
Still,

534
34:57.992 --> 35:01.829
your birthday passed while we were apart.

535
35:10.171 --> 35:11.756
Hurry up and sing for me.

536
35:11.839 --> 35:14.717
Happy birthday to you

537
35:14.800 --> 35:17.553
Happy birthday to you

538
35:17.637 --> 35:20.514
Happy birthday, dear Na Bo-bae

539
35:20.598 --> 35:23.142
Happy birthday to you

540
35:32.944 --> 35:36.739
Thank you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang, for celebrating my 30th birthday with me.

541
35:38.658 --> 35:41.369
Now we've done everything on my romance bucket list.

542
35:44.705 --> 35:45.790
Are you sure

543
35:46.624 --> 35:48.960
this is the last thing on your bucket list?

544
35:50.503 --> 35:52.004
There's nothing else you want to do?

545
35:53.381 --> 35:54.715
There's a lot.

546
35:55.299 --> 35:56.884
There's so much I want to do.

547
35:57.385 --> 36:00.388
You'll do all those things with me, right?

548
36:02.682 --> 36:03.766
I'll think about it.

549
36:05.059 --> 36:06.811
What's there to think about?

550
36:10.439 --> 36:12.441
Of course I'll do it with you.

551
36:12.942 --> 36:15.486
You're the one I like. Who else would I do it with?

552
36:21.367 --> 36:22.910
The cream!

553
36:22.994 --> 36:24.829
Huh? The cream?

554
36:26.455 --> 36:27.665
Don't!

555
36:27.748 --> 36:29.583
No! Stop.

556
36:29.667 --> 36:32.086
Oh! There's something I want to do.

557
36:47.143 --> 36:49.228
Are you ready for our date?

558
36:50.521 --> 36:52.982
Why are you watching me get ready?

559
36:59.613 --> 37:01.365
Seriously…

560
37:15.629 --> 37:17.840
Right. I'll have…

561
37:18.382 --> 37:21.052
I'll have Mr. Yoon bring the car.

562
37:21.135 --> 37:24.096
Huh? Isn't he working right now?

563
37:24.180 --> 37:25.556
Oh, is he?

564
37:25.639 --> 37:29.602
And I want to take the bus or subway instead of the car.

565
37:29.685 --> 37:30.811
Let's go somewhere busy.

566
37:31.520 --> 37:33.189
What? Why would you…

567
37:37.818 --> 37:40.529
I have a car, you know.

568
37:40.613 --> 37:43.616
Come on, I want to go somewhere crowded.

569
37:49.997 --> 37:53.876
The doors are closing.

570
37:58.381 --> 37:59.548
Did you see that?

571
37:59.632 --> 38:01.926
So many people here, and I didn't zap anyone.

572
38:04.303 --> 38:06.013
That's cute! I want to check it out.

573
38:07.723 --> 38:09.183
-How do I look? -You look silly.

574
38:12.937 --> 38:14.146
You're such a dork.

575
38:15.272 --> 38:16.107
A dork?

576
38:17.358 --> 38:18.484
So pretty!

577
38:18.567 --> 38:19.527
Rawr!

578
38:19.610 --> 38:21.612
Mr. Baek, jiggle it.

579
38:23.197 --> 38:24.698
So cute!

580
38:25.908 --> 38:27.201
What are you doing?

581
38:36.460 --> 38:37.294
No, I'm good.

582
38:41.298 --> 38:42.800
It's too big.

583
38:42.883 --> 38:43.759
You can do it.

584
38:47.763 --> 38:48.973
Are you ready?

585
38:49.473 --> 38:51.016
-Let's do this. -Okay.

586
38:57.898 --> 38:59.191
I have to say,

587
38:59.692 --> 39:02.236
a normal date like this is fun.

588
39:02.319 --> 39:03.195
Yeah.

589
39:03.279 --> 39:05.281
I never knew normal could be this nice.

590
39:21.255 --> 39:22.631
I'll meet you inside.

591
39:23.966 --> 39:25.384
Yeah, you should talk to her.

592
39:34.643 --> 39:36.228
Door unlocked.

593
39:42.109 --> 39:44.278
You looked like you were dying,

594
39:44.361 --> 39:46.572
but you ended up coming back

595
39:47.656 --> 39:48.574
with Ms. Na.

596
39:48.657 --> 39:50.576
Without Ms. Na Bo-bae,

597
39:51.744 --> 39:53.662
I would have died.

598
39:54.788 --> 39:57.791
Why are you here, Ms. Han?

599
39:57.875 --> 39:59.460
I thought we were done talking.

600
40:02.254 --> 40:05.758
I'm here to talk business as the director of Hanlim Advertising Company.

601
40:05.841 --> 40:08.135
Sterling Group canceled the meeting.

602
40:08.636 --> 40:11.263
They won't even negotiate without you, so--

603
40:11.347 --> 40:14.683
We have no reason to be involved now. You're as pragmatic as I am,

604
40:14.767 --> 40:16.560
so let's settle things between us.

605
40:18.020 --> 40:20.940
You can cancel the contract with TS Resort.

606
40:21.023 --> 40:22.608
If you want,

607
40:22.691 --> 40:25.402
you can announce that Hanlim pulled out first

608
40:25.486 --> 40:26.904
and use me as an excuse.

609
40:29.406 --> 40:30.741
That's irresponsible of you.

610
40:33.160 --> 40:35.621
Am I supposed to thank you for being considerate?

611
40:35.704 --> 40:37.748
If this is because of personal reasons--

612
40:37.831 --> 40:38.874
No, it's not.

613
40:38.958 --> 40:42.545
I'm trying to take responsibility for this situation.

614
40:49.510 --> 40:50.511
And

615
40:51.428 --> 40:52.638
I remember you.

616
40:53.889 --> 40:55.432
More than ten years ago,

617
40:56.016 --> 40:58.269
a middle school kid jumped in front of my car.

618
41:00.688 --> 41:04.525
I might have been a savior to you back then,

619
41:05.943 --> 41:07.444
but to me,

620
41:08.988 --> 41:11.156
you seemed like someone with a lot of scars,

621
41:11.657 --> 41:13.325
like my younger self.

622
41:13.909 --> 41:16.787
That's why I said what I said.

623
41:18.789 --> 41:21.166
To be honest, even now,

624
41:21.750 --> 41:24.628
I still see you as that kid from back then.

625
41:25.588 --> 41:27.047
I've changed.

626
41:27.756 --> 41:28.966
Is that so?

627
41:29.675 --> 41:30.593
Looks to me

628
41:31.969 --> 41:33.345
like you're still hanging by a thread.

629
41:34.388 --> 41:35.931
From now on,

630
41:36.015 --> 41:37.975
you have to really think about it.

631
41:38.642 --> 41:40.519
How to truly protect yourself.

632
41:41.895 --> 41:43.939
From Plan A to Plan Z.

633
41:44.732 --> 41:45.816
Be persistent.

634
42:13.552 --> 42:15.554
Why are you still out here?

635
42:19.183 --> 42:22.227
"Without Ms. Na Bo-bae, I would have died"?

636
42:25.314 --> 42:26.607
You heard everything?

637
42:26.690 --> 42:28.108
I could hear everything.

638
42:28.192 --> 42:29.985
Even the part where you rejected her.

639
42:43.999 --> 42:46.251
When I heard him say he would've died without me,

640
42:46.335 --> 42:48.170
I realized something.

641
42:49.004 --> 42:53.008
It didn't matter whether I'd drained all my powers saving Mr. Baek Ho-rang,

642
42:53.092 --> 42:56.553
or whether they'd come back again one day.

643
42:58.681 --> 43:02.309
Meeting him was a one-in-a-million chance,

644
43:02.393 --> 43:06.438
just like the lightning that struck me.

645
43:08.816 --> 43:14.196
And I want to risk everything to protect him.

646
43:23.372 --> 43:27.543
Just like he risked everything to love me.

647
43:28.043 --> 43:30.254
Electricity, charging, death.

648
43:30.838 --> 43:33.757
None of that ever mattered.

649
43:47.438 --> 43:48.605
So pretty.

650
44:03.370 --> 44:04.204
You're here.

651
44:04.872 --> 44:06.123
You're an hour late.

652
44:06.206 --> 44:08.041
I heard Sterling canceled the meeting.

653
44:18.427 --> 44:19.595
Try on a dress.

654
44:20.471 --> 44:21.764
By the way,

655
44:21.847 --> 44:25.392
I like seeing your neck and shoulders.

656
44:27.227 --> 44:30.689
Even with your new position, you're still the same.

657
44:33.317 --> 44:35.486
Come on, let's stop talking about work.

658
44:36.111 --> 44:39.031
Let's talk about us. About our wedding.

659
44:39.114 --> 44:42.201
This is why you'll always be in Baek Ho-rang's shadow.

660
44:44.745 --> 44:47.581
You don't hide your greed, but your work is sloppy.

661
44:50.542 --> 44:51.585
Han Seol-hee.

662
44:53.462 --> 44:55.631
Did you forget we're getting married?

663
44:55.714 --> 44:58.217
You expect me to risk my life on someone like you?

664
44:59.593 --> 45:00.427
Marriage?

665
45:01.261 --> 45:02.262
Know your place.

666
45:03.722 --> 45:06.141
-Hey, Han Seol-hee. -Are you crazy? Let go!

667
45:06.225 --> 45:07.726
That hurts!

668
45:08.435 --> 45:11.980
Hey, how much longer do I have to know my place?

669
45:12.606 --> 45:13.982
What is my place?

670
45:14.066 --> 45:15.651
What do you even know about me?

671
45:16.652 --> 45:18.195
-Let go! -Sir, please calm down.

672
45:18.278 --> 45:19.738
Please calm down.

673
45:22.366 --> 45:23.909
Goddamn it.

674
45:27.579 --> 45:28.413
Hey.

675
45:28.497 --> 45:30.040
Let's get you up.

676
45:30.541 --> 45:31.834
Han Seol-hee.

677
45:32.543 --> 45:33.919
Han Seol-hee!

678
45:34.962 --> 45:35.963
Han Seol-hee!

679
45:39.925 --> 45:41.385
Sir, please calm down.

680
45:41.468 --> 45:42.761
-You can't do this. -Move!

681
45:42.845 --> 45:43.887
Out of my way!

682
45:48.350 --> 45:49.852
Sir, you can't drive like this!

683
45:49.935 --> 45:50.936
He shouldn't…

684
45:54.690 --> 45:58.110
Choi Do-yoon, I heard the Sterling meeting got canceled. What's going on?

685
45:58.193 --> 45:59.027
Why?

686
45:59.611 --> 46:01.488
Are you going to blame me again?

687
46:01.572 --> 46:02.406
What?

688
46:02.990 --> 46:05.200
Do-yoon, have you been drinking?

689
46:05.284 --> 46:08.662
You're also like this because I'm not Baek Ho-rang!

690
46:09.997 --> 46:13.125
Has anyone ever tried to listen to what I think and feel?

691
46:13.709 --> 46:17.713
Mom, you know Do-yoon won the fencing competition, right?

692
46:18.589 --> 46:20.465
Since Ho-rang is stuck in bed,

693
46:20.549 --> 46:23.218
Do-yoon brought his trophy to show him.

694
46:23.302 --> 46:25.095
I'LL COME SEE YOU AFTER I FINISH UP FROM MOM

695
46:25.178 --> 46:27.472
He's such a sweet boy, isn't he?

696
46:29.266 --> 46:30.851
Take out your trophy.

697
46:31.435 --> 46:32.728
Show it to Ho-rang.

698
46:33.353 --> 46:35.022
Yeah, take it out and show him.

699
46:44.072 --> 46:46.158
It'll get in the way when they change his IV.

700
46:47.534 --> 46:48.744
Put it on the floor.

701
46:56.460 --> 46:58.629
It was just a school fencing competition.

702
46:58.712 --> 47:01.298
She just wants to brag about Do-yoon, Mother.

703
47:01.381 --> 47:06.345
I was supposed to go to my friend's today. Now I'm stuck here because of you.

704
47:07.220 --> 47:09.306
You're so annoying. I didn't ask you to come.

705
47:09.389 --> 47:12.142
I only came 'cause my mom and dad dragged me here.

706
47:13.143 --> 47:15.562
Can't you call your dad and ask him to come quickly?

707
47:21.485 --> 47:22.653
Give it back.

708
47:26.490 --> 47:29.284
Auntie, Uncle.

709
47:30.327 --> 47:31.662
When will you be here?

710
47:32.913 --> 47:35.832
Ho-rang is in big trouble right now.

711
47:36.333 --> 47:37.751
Come quickly.

712
48:11.576 --> 48:14.329
TS GROUP VP IN CAR ACCIDENT

713
48:19.960 --> 48:22.045
TS GROUP VP AND WIFE FOUND DEAD IN CRASH

714
48:22.713 --> 48:24.965
I was just a child too!

715
48:25.465 --> 48:26.717
Just a scared child

716
48:26.800 --> 48:28.635
who wanted to run away!

717
48:30.387 --> 48:32.389
Why is it always my fault?

718
48:32.472 --> 48:34.599
Why am I always the troublemaker?

719
48:35.225 --> 48:38.979
If any of you cared for me half as much as you did for Baek Ho-rang,

720
48:39.062 --> 48:42.149
my life wouldn't have turned out this pathetic!

721
48:42.232 --> 48:44.026
Do-yoon. Choi Do-yoon!

722
48:44.109 --> 48:46.028
Where are you? You need to…

723
49:15.932 --> 49:20.187
I reported him for kidnapping and spiking your drink.

724
49:20.270 --> 49:22.898
He was also arrested for property damage at a wedding shop,

725
49:22.981 --> 49:26.401
drunk driving, and assaulting a police officer.

726
49:27.235 --> 49:30.197
TS Hotel issued a statement taking full responsibility

727
49:30.280 --> 49:33.033
and expressed their intention to make things right.

728
49:33.867 --> 49:35.994
If this turns into a TS Group issue,

729
49:36.995 --> 49:40.040
my grandmother won't let my aunt off the hook.

730
49:40.957 --> 49:42.334
Smart move.

731
49:45.670 --> 49:47.130
Change the nameplate back.

732
49:47.214 --> 49:49.216
As of today, my aunt and Choi Do-yoon

733
49:49.883 --> 49:51.093
are out of the picture.

734
49:52.928 --> 49:53.762
Yes, sir.

735
50:26.461 --> 50:29.131
I won't get in the way of whatever you two choose to do.

736
50:30.173 --> 50:33.135
I know that trying to separate you will only make you inseparable.

737
50:33.635 --> 50:34.469
But remember this.

738
50:36.138 --> 50:37.264
Just don't embarrass yourself.

739
50:38.098 --> 50:40.475
And don't think your position is yours forever.

740
50:41.476 --> 50:42.310
Okay.

741
50:43.562 --> 50:44.980
Ma'am.

742
50:47.482 --> 50:50.986
May I say just one thing?

743
50:56.241 --> 50:59.119
You're worried about Mr. Baek Ho-rang, aren't you?

744
51:00.036 --> 51:02.038
Can't you just be honest

745
51:02.122 --> 51:04.207
and tell him you're worried about him?

746
51:05.250 --> 51:07.335
I can see how worried you are

747
51:07.419 --> 51:09.045
from the way you look at him.

748
51:10.130 --> 51:13.133
I can see how much you care about him.

749
51:13.216 --> 51:16.511
But if you don't show it, he won't know how you feel.

750
51:19.014 --> 51:22.767
And both you and Mr. Baek Ho-rang

751
51:22.851 --> 51:24.311
will end up hurting.

752
51:28.356 --> 51:29.566
Hi!

753
51:29.649 --> 51:31.735
Oh my, you're so cute.

754
51:31.818 --> 51:33.320
So adorable.

755
51:33.403 --> 51:35.280
I'll walk you to your car.

756
51:39.242 --> 51:40.869
You're so cute.

757
51:43.705 --> 51:48.126
Your grandmother's the type to say no when she disagrees, right?

758
51:49.711 --> 51:50.587
Yes.

759
51:52.088 --> 51:53.048
See?

760
51:53.131 --> 51:56.301
I told you she loves you very much.

761
51:56.801 --> 51:59.095
She just doesn't show it.

762
52:00.430 --> 52:01.348
Not true.

763
52:02.224 --> 52:04.100
She looks pretty baffled right now.

764
52:04.184 --> 52:07.103
I'm telling you, I'm right.

765
52:12.108 --> 52:13.276
Well…

766
52:14.486 --> 52:18.114
I sent your favorite tea

767
52:18.949 --> 52:21.826
and the Shine Muscat jam to your secretary earlier.

768
52:22.494 --> 52:23.703
Please have some later.

769
52:23.787 --> 52:25.413
What's gotten into you?

770
52:26.081 --> 52:27.290
You even thought of me.

771
52:28.416 --> 52:30.961
Ms. Na Bo-bae told me to.

772
52:35.924 --> 52:36.841
So cute.

773
52:40.053 --> 52:41.638
What's your plan with her?

774
52:44.641 --> 52:46.935
I'll have some good news for you soon.

775
53:03.034 --> 53:05.036
The groom will now enter.

776
53:06.413 --> 53:08.456
A big round of applause, please.

777
53:33.189 --> 53:34.316
Cut!

778
53:34.399 --> 53:35.608
You scared me!

779
53:35.692 --> 53:36.860
-Let's roll. -All good?

780
53:36.943 --> 53:39.195
You brat. You gonna ask me that after every take?

781
53:39.279 --> 53:41.906
Nervous about your directorial debut, Seo-jeong?

782
53:41.990 --> 53:43.033
Was it bad?

783
53:43.116 --> 53:45.535
The shot was shaky. Do another take.

784
53:47.495 --> 53:49.039
-Okay. That was good. -Okay?

785
53:49.122 --> 53:51.875
-Why ask if you were gonna approve it? -Just 'cause.

786
53:51.958 --> 53:53.752
-You're okay with a shaky shot? -Yes.

787
53:53.835 --> 53:56.629
Caught a whiff of something sweet among the shaking flowers?

788
53:56.713 --> 53:57.714
While walking…

789
53:57.797 --> 53:59.799
-Ms. Na, you're here. -Na Bo-bae!

790
53:59.883 --> 54:01.509
-No traffic? -Bo-bae!

791
54:01.593 --> 54:04.387
Oh, Ms. Na. You're here.

792
54:04.471 --> 54:06.639
Thanks so much for guest starring, Eun-ho.

793
54:06.723 --> 54:08.391
And you wouldn't even take a fee.

794
54:08.475 --> 54:10.977
It's an honor to be in your show.

795
54:11.603 --> 54:13.772
But I'm a little upset.

796
54:15.273 --> 54:17.984
I kept begging you to let me play the lead.

797
54:18.068 --> 54:19.736
You can't play the lead.

798
54:19.819 --> 54:21.988
-Because you're my number one fan. -True.

799
54:22.697 --> 54:26.409
I'm going to become a writer worthy of being chosen by a top star like you,

800
54:26.493 --> 54:28.453
and not just because you're my fan.

801
54:30.163 --> 54:32.665
I guess I'll see you then.

802
54:32.749 --> 54:33.875
As writer and actor.

803
54:35.293 --> 54:38.546
Until then, I'll keep guest starring in your shows

804
54:38.630 --> 54:40.757
and make sure you don't forget me.

805
54:41.633 --> 54:42.509
Na Bo-bae!

806
54:44.302 --> 54:47.764
We just shot Eun-ho's wedding entrance scene.

807
54:47.847 --> 54:49.682
Is the shoot going well, Director Cho?

808
54:49.766 --> 54:52.727
I've been put through the wringer under Director Yeom.

809
54:53.645 --> 54:55.021
Of course I nailed it.

810
54:55.939 --> 54:58.400
Put through the wringer? You?

811
54:58.483 --> 55:02.070
I taught you, guided you, gave you love and joy. I did it all.

812
55:02.153 --> 55:03.363
-Oh! Thank you. -"Oh"?

813
55:03.446 --> 55:05.824
-I heard you, okay? -One sec. You little…

814
55:05.907 --> 55:07.992
Those two always crack me up.

815
55:17.502 --> 55:19.170
Ms. Na. Let's go.

816
55:23.299 --> 55:25.802
Ms. Na. Please sit here.

817
55:25.885 --> 55:27.804
It's been a while. You look great.

818
55:27.887 --> 55:30.265
Have some coffee, Secretary… I mean, Ms. Na.

819
55:30.348 --> 55:33.101
You ladies are making me feel so awkward.

820
55:33.184 --> 55:35.854
My butt's a little sore. Can I use this cushion?

821
55:35.937 --> 55:38.440
No need to feel awkward. You're a writer.

822
55:40.066 --> 55:40.984
Have a seat.

823
55:44.487 --> 55:45.989
Well, it's good.

824
55:46.072 --> 55:47.323
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

825
55:47.824 --> 55:50.952
Are you here to watch the shoot too? Because I said I'd be here?

826
55:51.035 --> 55:53.788
Of course. I'm your fan, after all.

827
55:54.831 --> 55:57.125
And since we're shooting at TS Resort,

828
55:57.208 --> 55:59.711
I wanted to check on things as the owner.

829
55:59.794 --> 56:02.839
Man, this punk made me bring a full A-to-Z plan

830
56:02.922 --> 56:06.926
when I asked for a location sponsorship and made a damn fuss--

831
56:07.010 --> 56:09.387
You're yapping again. Your blood sugar must be low.

832
56:10.096 --> 56:12.765
Yes, we'll get started now!

833
56:12.849 --> 56:14.100
Eun-ho, take that and…

834
56:14.684 --> 56:16.978
-I'm counting on you! -Just roll already!

835
56:17.061 --> 56:19.022
-We'll start rolling! -You're so loud.

836
56:19.105 --> 56:21.357
Ready!

837
56:24.194 --> 56:25.028
Ready!

838
56:26.112 --> 56:27.405
Action!

839
56:27.989 --> 56:28.823
Shush.

840
56:34.913 --> 56:37.165
If I were the main character in a drama,

841
56:39.083 --> 56:41.419
this is how I'd be introduced.

842
56:47.050 --> 56:48.468
Name, Na Bo-bae.

843
56:49.052 --> 56:53.348
A woman over 30 with an uncertain future ahead of her.

844
56:56.768 --> 56:59.020
THE BODYGUARD IN MY HEART WRITER NA BO-BAE

845
57:20.500 --> 57:23.962
WRITTEN BY NA BO-BAE

846
57:25.338 --> 57:27.507
My name! Did you see my name?

847
57:27.590 --> 57:30.885
But then again, the future is always uncertain.

848
57:30.969 --> 57:31.970
Are you crying?

849
57:32.929 --> 57:33.763
I'm not.

850
57:35.932 --> 57:37.809
Something got in my eye.

851
57:37.892 --> 57:39.561
You're just so cute.

852
57:39.644 --> 57:40.853
And now,

853
57:40.937 --> 57:43.690
I have someone to walk hand in hand with into that future.

854
57:43.773 --> 57:45.692
-So cute! -What's with you?

855
57:50.488 --> 57:51.948
I just felt a tingle.

856
57:52.991 --> 57:53.992
Huh?

857
57:54.617 --> 57:55.535
Static electricity?

858
57:55.618 --> 57:56.828
Yes.

859
57:57.870 --> 57:58.705
But

860
57:59.706 --> 58:01.040
it didn't hurt.

861
58:05.587 --> 58:08.840
No matter who I am, as long as you love me

862
58:10.049 --> 58:13.177
and we can keep charging each other forever,

863
58:13.761 --> 58:15.722
we can go anywhere.

864
58:17.181 --> 58:20.101
Together, always.

865
01:00:17.176 --> 01:00:21.806
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
